[E-POSITIVITY] Error: field `x` depends on `p`, whose type contains `T`
    ╭─[ soundness/termination-relies-on-positivity-01-direct.sw:18:37 ]
    │
 18 │ type T: Type = | Mk (p: PBox T) (x: Tag T p) | In (t: T)
    │                                     ───┬───  
    │                                        ╰───── `x`'s type mentions `p`
    │ 
    │ Note 1: a field's type can't mention an earlier field that holds a `T` (or holds one inside another type): `T` would then have to be defined together with what that field's type says about it, which isn't supported
    │ 
    │ Note 2: state it as a separate proposition about the value, or keep what it needs in an index
────╯
